WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.823
Pre-aggregation can help control grain First
summarize the fact table

00:00:05.849 --> 00:00:11.375
to the level you actually need Then perform later
joins or pivots from

00:00:11.389 --> 00:00:17.422
that stable grain This separates fact aggregation
from presentation reshaping

00:00:17.436 --> 00:00:19.686
and can make the query easier to verify
